    emotion: 1
    text: The client is unaware of any issues. Your profit takes a hit, but during
      the final account with the screeder you are able to show that as an act of
      goodwill you fixed their issue, and use this as a point of negotiation to reduce
      their overall claim. You recover 75% of the costs.
